<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Pechacan — Educación canina desde el vínculo</title>
<meta name="description" content="Educación canina y adiestramiento desde la parte emocional del perro. Sesiones online y presenciales en Algeciras, concierge para adopción y masterclass de reactividad.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..144,300;0,9..144,400;0,9..144,500;0,9..144,600;0,9..144,700;1,9..144,400;1,9..144,500;1,9..144,600&family=Nunito:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,500&family=Caveat:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  box-sizing:border-box;
  --lila:#DAC4D9;
  --lila-suave:#EFE4EF;
  --lila-hondo:#A88AAE;
  --mostaza:#F2A615;
  --mostaza-suave:#FBDFA6;
  --rosita:#F4C7C1;
  --mantequilla:#F6E2A8;
  --crema:#FBF6F0;
  --crema-2:#F5EEE4;
  --tinta:#443145;
  --tinta-suave:#6E5A70;
  --tinta-mas:#2E2130;
  padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);
  padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
}
*{box-sizing:inherit;}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth; scroll-padding-top:96px;}
body{
  margin:0;
  background:var(--crema);
  color:var(--tinta);
  font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;
  font-weight:500;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
img{max-width:100%;display:block;}
h1,h2,h3,h4,.display{
  font-family:'Fraunces',serif;
  font-weight:500;
  letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  margin:0;
  color:var(--tinta);
}
.script{
  font-family:'Caveat',cursive;
  color:var(--lila-hondo);
  font-weight:600;
}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}
.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 32px;}
@media (max-width:640px){.wrap{padding:0 22px;}}

/* ---- orejita motif ---- */
svg.orejita{display:block;}

/* ---- HEADER / NAV ---- */
header.site{
  position:fixed;
  top:0;left:0;right:0;
  z-index:100;
  background:rgba(251,246,240,.88);
  backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
  border-bottom:1px solid rgba(168,138,174,.18);
}
.nav-inner{
  max-width:1080px;
  margin:0 auto;
  padding:14px 32px;
  display:flex;
  align-items:center;
  justify-content:space-between;
  gap:20px;
}
@media (max-width:640px){.nav-inner{padding:14px 22px;}}
.brand-mark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
.brand-mark img{height:34px;width:auto;}
.brand-mark .word{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;font-size:22px;color:var(--tinta);display:none;}
nav.links{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;}
nav.links button.navlink{
  font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;
  font-weight:700;
  font-size:14.5px;
  color:var(--tinta-suave);
  background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;
  padding:8px 12px;border-radius:99px;
  transition:color .2s, background .2s;
}
nav.links button.navlink:hover{color:var(--tinta);background:var(--lila-suave);}
nav.links button.navlink.active{color:var(--tinta);background:var(--lila);}
.nav-cta{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;
  font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:14px;
  background:var(--mostaza);color:var(--tinta-mas);
  padding:10px 18px;border-radius:99px;border:none;cursor:pointer;
  white-space:nowrap;
  transition:transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease;
  box-shadow:0 6px 16px rgba(242,166,21,.28);
}
.nav-cta:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:0 9px 20px rgba(242,166,21,.38);}
.burger{display:none;background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;padding:8px;}
.burger span{display:block;width:22px;height:2px;background:var(--tinta);margin:5px 0;border-radius:2px;}

@media (max-width:860px){
  nav.links{
    position:fixed;top:64px;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;
    background:var(--crema);
    flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;
    padding:14px 22px 40px;
    gap:4px;
    transform:translateX(100%);
    transition:transform .28s ease;
    overflow-y:auto;
  }
  nav.links.open{transform:translateX(0);}
  nav.links button.navlink{text-align:left;font-size:19px;padding:14px 10px;border-radius:14px;}
  .burger{display:block;}
  .nav-cta.desktop-only{display:none;}
}
@media (min-width:861px){
  .burger{display:none;}
  .nav-cta.mobile-only{display:none;}
}

/* ---- PAGES ---- */
.page{display:none;}
.page.active{display:block;animation:fadein .5s ease both;}
@keyframes fadein{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}}

section{padding:96px 0;position:relative;}
section.tight{padding:72px 0;}
@media (max-width:640px){section{padding:64px 0;}section.tight{padding:52px 0;}}

.eyebrow{font-family:'Caveat',cursive;font-size:25px;color:var(--lila-hondo);margin:0 0 4px;}
.eyebrow.on-dark{color:var(--mostaza-suave);}
.eyebrow.mostaza{color:var(--mostaza);}
h2.title{font-size:clamp(30px,4.2vw,46px);line-height:1.1;max-width:680px;}
h2.title em{font-style:italic;color:var(--lila-hondo);}
.lead{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--tinta-suave);max-width:600px;margin-top:16px;}
.lead.on-dark{color:#D9C9DB;}

.btn{
  display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;
  font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:15.5px;
  padding:14px 26px;border-radius:99px;border:none;cursor:pointer;
  transition:transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease;
}
.btn-mostaza{background:var(--mostaza);color:var(--tinta-mas);box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(242,166,21,.3);}
.btn-mostaza:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 12px 24px rgba(242,166,21,.4);}
.btn-lila{background:var(--tinta);color:var(--crema);}
.btn-lila:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);}
.btn-outline{background:transparent;border:1.5px solid currentColor;color:var(--tinta);}
.btn-outline:hover{background:rgba(68,49,69,.06);}
.btn-outline.on-dark{color:var(--crema);}
.btn-outline.on-dark:hover{background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);}

hr.div{border:none;height:1px;background:var(--lila-suave);margin:0;}

/* ---------------- HOME ---------------- */
.hero-home{
  min-height:92svh;
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;
  padding:150px 0 70px;
  position:relative;
  background:var(--crema);
  overflow:hidden;
}
.hero-bg{
  position:absolute;inset:0;
  background-size:cover;
  background-position:center 28%;
}
.hero-tint{
  position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:
    linear-gradient(100deg, var(--crema) 0%, var(--crema) 30%, rgba(251,246,240,.96) 46%, rgba(251,246,240,.68) 62%, rgba(251,246,240,.26) 80%, rgba(251,246,240,.06) 100%),
    linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(68,49,69,.24), transparent 42%),
    radial-gradient(55% 45% at 88% 12%, rgba(242,166,21,.16), transparent 60%);
}
@media (max-width:780px){
  .hero-bg{background-position:center 20%;}
  .hero-tint{
    background:
      linear-gradient(185deg, var(--crema) 0%, var(--crema) 46%, rgba(251,246,240,.95) 62%, rgba(251,246,240,.62) 80%, rgba(251,246,240,.2) 100%),
      linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(68,49,69,.24), transparent 40%);
  }
}
.hero-home .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;}
.hero-home .eyebrow{font-size:27px;text-shadow:0 2px 18px rgba(251,246,240,.9);}
.hero-home h1{
  font-size:clamp(38px,6.4vw,74px);
  line-height:1.04;
  max-width:820px;
  text-shadow:0 2px 26px rgba(251,246,240,.85);
}
.hero-home h1 em{
  font-style:italic;color:var(--tinta);
  background:var(--mostaza-suave);
  padding:1px 16px 7px;
  border-radius:16px;
  display:inline-block;
  text-shadow:none;
}
.hero-home .lede{font-size:19px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--tinta-suave);max-width:520px;margin-top:24px;text-shadow:0 2px 18px rgba(251,246,240,.85);}
.hero-home .cta-row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin-top:38px;}

.valores{margin-top:56px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:36px 30px;}
@media (max-width:760px){.valores{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px;}}
.valor .mark{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;color:var(--mostaza);font-size:28px;margin-bottom:8px;}
.valor h3{font-size:20px;margin-bottom:6px;}
.valor p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--tinta-suave);margin:0;}

/* servicio rows on home */
.servicios-home{margin-top:52px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
.servicio-row{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;
  padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--lila-suave);
  cursor:pointer;background:none;border-left:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;
  width:100%;text-align:left;font-family:inherit;color:inherit;
  transition:padding-left .22s ease, background .22s ease, transform .22s ease;
}
.servicio-row:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--lila-suave);}
.servicio-row:hover{padding-left:14px;background:var(--crema-2);transform:scale(1.015);}
.servicio-row .left{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:18px;}
.servicio-row .num{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;color:var(--lila);font-size:16px;min-width:26px;transition:color .22s ease;}
.servicio-row:hover .num{color:var(--mostaza);}
.servicio-row h3{font-size:23px;transition:color .22s ease;}
.servicio-row:hover h3{color:var(--lila-hondo);}
.servicio-row .desc{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--tinta-suave);margin-top:4px;max-width:420px;}
.servicio-row .price{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px;color:var(--lila-hondo);white-space:nowrap;}
.servicio-row .arrow{width:22px;height:22px;flex-shrink:0;color:var(--tinta-suave);transition:transform .22s ease;}
.servicio-row:hover .arrow{transform:translateX(4px);color:var(--mostaza);}

/* tono grid */
.tono-grid{margin-top:48px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:22px;}
@media (max-width:700px){.tono-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.tono-card{background:var(--crema-2);border-radius:24px;padding:28px 26px;}
.tono-card.no{background:transparent;border:1.5px dashed var(--lila);}
.tono-card .flag{font-family:'Caveat',cursive;font-size:22px;color:var(--mostaza);}
.tono-card.no .flag{color:var(--tinta-suave);}
.tono-card p.example{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5;margin:10px 0 12px;}
.tono-card p.note{font-size:14px;color:var(--tinta-suave);margin:0;}

.publico{margin-top:50px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:48px;}
@media (max-width:820px){.publico{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px;}}
.publico ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;}
.publico li{display:flex;gap:14px;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--tinta-suave);}
.publico li svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:4px;}
.publico .avoid{background:var(--tinta);color:var(--crema);border-radius:26px;padding:32px 30px;}
.publico .avoid h4{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:19px;color:var(--mostaza-suave);margin-bottom:10px;}
.publico .avoid p{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#D9C9DB;margin:0 0 10px;}
.publico .avoid p:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}

.testimonial{margin-top:70px;text-align:center;}
.testimonial .script{font-size:32px;line-height:1.45;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto;display:block;}

/* ---------------- SHARED SUBPAGE HERO ---------------- */
.subhero{padding:150px 0 60px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;}
.subhero .wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;}
.subhero h1{font-size:clamp(32px,5.4vw,58px);line-height:1.08;max-width:700px;}
.subhero h1 em{font-style:italic;}
.subhero .lede{font-size:18px;line-height:1.6;max-width:520px;margin-top:20px;}
.subhero.lila-bg{background:radial-gradient(60% 55% at 85% 15%, var(--lila-suave), transparent 60%), var(--crema);}
.subhero.lila-bg h1 em{color:var(--lila-hondo);}
.subhero.dark-bg{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--tinta-mas),var(--tinta));}
.subhero.dark-bg h1{color:var(--crema);}
.subhero.dark-bg h1 em{color:var(--mostaza-suave);}
.subhero.dark-bg .lede{color:#D9C9DB;}
.subhero.dark-bg .eyebrow{color:var(--mostaza-suave);}
.subhero.warm-bg{background:radial-gradient(65% 55% at 85% 10%, var(--rosita), transparent 62%), radial-gradient(50% 40% at 10% 90%, var(--mantequilla), transparent 60%), var(--crema);}

/* ---------------- MODALIDAD TOGGLE (educacion) ---------------- */
.modalidad-toggle{
  display:inline-flex;background:var(--crema-2);border-radius:99px;padding:5px;margin-top:44px;gap:4px;
}
.modalidad-toggle button{
  font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;
  padding:11px 22px;border-radius:99px;border:none;cursor:pointer;background:none;color:var(--tinta-suave);
  transition:background .2s,color .2s;
}
.modalidad-toggle button.active{background:var(--tinta);color:var(--crema);}

.panel-modalidad{display:none;margin-top:36px;}
.panel-modalidad.active{display:block;animation:fadein .35s ease both;}
.panel-note{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--tinta-suave);margin-bottom:26px;max-width:520px;}

.precio-lista{display:flex;flex-direction:column;}
.precio-row{
  display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;
  padding:26px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--lila-suave);
}
.precio-row:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--lila-suave);}
.precio-row .info h4{font-size:19px;margin-bottom:5px;}
.precio-row .info p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--tinta-suave);line-height:1.55;margin:0;max-width:440px;}
.precio-row .price{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:26px;color:var(--lila-hondo);white-space:nowrap;}
.precio-row.destacado .price{color:var(--mostaza);}

.pasos{margin-top:60px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:30px;}
@media (max-width:760px){.pasos{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.paso{padding:22px;border-radius:20px;transition:background .22s ease, transform .22s ease;}
.paso:hover{background:var(--crema-2);transform:translateY(-4px) scale(1.02);}
.paso .n{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;color:var(--lila);font-size:30px;margin-bottom:8px;transition:color .22s ease;}
.paso:hover .n{color:var(--mostaza);}
.paso h4{font-size:18px;margin-bottom:6px;}
.paso p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--tinta-suave);line-height:1.55;margin:0;}

/* ---------------- ADOPCION ---------------- */
.concierge-compare{margin-top:60px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:26px;}
@media (max-width:760px){.concierge-compare{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.concierge-card{
  border-radius:28px;padding:34px 30px;background:var(--crema-2);
  display:flex;flex-direction:column;
  transition:transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
}
.concierge-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px) scale(1.015);box-shadow:0 18px 34px rgba(68,49,69,.14);}
.concierge-card.destacado{background:var(--tinta);color:var(--crema);}
.concierge-card.destacado:hover{box-shadow:0 18px 34px rgba(46,33,48,.35);}
.concierge-card .tag{font-family:'Caveat',cursive;font-size:20px;color:var(--lila-hondo);margin-bottom:6px;}
.concierge-card.destacado .tag{color:var(--mostaza-suave);}
.concierge-card.destacado h3{color:var(--crema);}
.concierge-card h3{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:4px;}
.concierge-card .price{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:34px;color:var(--mostaza);margin:12px 0 16px;}
.concierge-card ul{list-style:none;margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;flex:1;}
.concierge-card li{display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.5;color:var(--tinta-suave);}
.concierge-card.destacado li{color:#D9C9DB;}
.concierge-card li svg{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;color:var(--mostaza);}

/* ---------------- REACTIVIDAD ---------------- */
.reactividad-product{
  margin-top:56px;
  background:var(--tinta);color:var(--crema);
  border-radius:32px;padding:46px 40px;
  display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.3fr 1fr;gap:36px;align-items:center;
}
@media (max-width:760px){.reactividad-product{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:34px 26px;}}
.reactividad-product h3{color:var(--crema);font-size:26px;margin-bottom:10px;}
.reactividad-product p{color:#D9C9DB;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 22px;}
.reactividad-price-box{text-align:center;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border-radius:22px;padding:26px 20px;}
.reactividad-price-box .price{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:44px;color:var(--mostaza-suave);}
.reactividad-price-box .unit{font-size:13px;color:#C9B8CB;margin-top:2px;}

.semanas{margin-top:60px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;}
@media (max-width:860px){.semanas{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
@media (max-width:520px){.semanas{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.semana{background:var(--crema-2);border-radius:22px;padding:24px 22px;transition:transform .22s ease, background .22s ease;}
.semana:hover{transform:translateY(-5px) scale(1.03);background:#fff;}
.semana .n{font-family:'Caveat',cursive;font-size:22px;color:var(--lila-hondo);}
.semana h4{font-size:17px;margin:4px 0 6px;}
.semana p{font-size:14px;color:var(--tinta-suave);line-height:1.5;margin:0;}

/* ---------------- CONTACTO ---------------- */
.contacto-grid{margin-top:50px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.1fr;gap:56px;}
@media (max-width:900px){.contacto-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px;}}
.contacto-info{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:26px;}
.contacto-info .item{display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;}
.contacto-info .item svg{flex-shrink:0;color:var(--mostaza);margin-top:3px;}
.contacto-info .item h4{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:2px;}
.contacto-info .item p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--tinta-suave);margin:0;line-height:1.5;}
.contacto-info .item a{color:var(--lila-hondo);font-weight:700;}

form.contacto{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;}
.field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;}
.field label{font-size:13.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--tinta);}
.field input, .field select, .field textarea{
  font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:var(--tinta);
  border:1.5px solid var(--lila);border-radius:14px;
  padding:13px 16px;background:var(--crema-2);
  outline:none;transition:border-color .2s, background .2s;
  resize:vertical;
}
.field input:focus, .field select:focus, .field textarea:focus{border-color:var(--lila-hondo);background:#fff;}
.field-row{display:flex;gap:14px;}
@media (max-width:520px){.field-row{flex-direction:column;}}
.form-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--tinta-suave);margin-top:2px;}

/* ---------------- FOOTER ---------------- */
footer.site{background:var(--tinta-mas);color:var(--crema);padding:64px 0 34px;}
.footer-top{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;}
.footer-brand img{height:40px;opacity:.95;}
.footer-brand .script{color:var(--mostaza-suave);font-size:22px;margin-top:14px;display:block;}
.footer-cols{display:flex;gap:56px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.footer-col h5{font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.02em;color:#B9A8BB;margin-bottom:14px;}
.footer-col a, .footer-col span{display:block;font-size:14.5px;color:#E4D7E5;margin-bottom:10px;}
.footer-col a:hover{color:var(--mostaza-suave);}
footer.site hr.div{background:rgba(255,255,255,.12);margin:44px 0 26px;}
.footer-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;font-size:13px;color:#9E8CA0;}

/* focus visibility */
a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, select:focus-visible, textarea:focus-visible{
  outline:2.5px solid var(--mostaza);outline-offset:2px;
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  *{animation:none !important;transition:none !important;}
}

/* ---- modal de confirmación ---- */
.modal-overlay{
  position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:300;
  background:rgba(46,33,48,.55);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  padding:24px;
  animation:fadein .25s ease both;
}
.modal-overlay[hidden]{display:none;}
.modal-box{
  background:var(--crema);border-radius:28px;
  padding:40px 34px;max-width:420px;width:100%;
  text-align:center;position:relative;
  box-shadow:0 24px 60px rgba(46,33,48,.35);
  animation:modalPop .3s ease both;
}
@keyframes modalPop{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(14px) scale(.97);}to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}}
.modal-close{
  position:absolute;top:16px;right:16px;
  width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;border:none;
  background:var(--crema-2);color:var(--tinta-suave);cursor:pointer;
  font-size:15px;transition:background .2s ease, color .2s ease;
}
.modal-close:hover{background:var(--lila-suave);color:var(--tinta);}
.modal-icon{
  width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mostaza);color:var(--tinta-mas);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 18px;
  font-size:26px;font-weight:800;
}
.modal-box h3{font-size:22px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.modal-box p{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--tinta-suave);margin:0 0 24px;}
.modal-box p a{color:var(--lila-hondo);font-weight:800;}

/* ---- promo banner (masterclass reactividad) ---- */
.promo-banner{
  padding:0;
  background:linear-gradient(100deg, var(--tinta-mas) 0%, var(--tinta) 60%);
}
.promo-inner{
  padding:34px 32px;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.promo-headline{
  font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;
  color:var(--crema);font-size:clamp(19px,2.6vw,26px);line-height:1.35;margin-top:4px;
}

/* ---- mid page cta ---- */
.mid-cta{
  margin-top:54px;padding-top:40px;border-top:1px solid var(--lila-suave);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;
}
.mid-cta p{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:19px;color:var(--tinta-suave);margin:0;}

/* ---- quiz interactivo ---- */
.quiz-options{margin-top:40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:700px;}
.quiz-opt{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;text-align:left;
  font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-size:16.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--tinta);
  background:var(--crema-2);border:1.5px solid transparent;border-radius:18px;
  padding:20px 22px;cursor:pointer;
  transition:border-color .2s ease, background .2s ease, transform .18s ease;
}
.quiz-opt:hover{transform:translateX(4px) scale(1.015);border-color:var(--lila);background:var(--lila-suave);}
.quiz-opt.active{border-color:var(--mostaza);background:var(--mostaza-suave);}
.quiz-opt .q-mark{font-size:22px;color:var(--lila-hondo);flex-shrink:0;min-width:24px;}
.quiz-result{
  margin-top:32px;max-width:600px;background:var(--tinta);color:var(--crema);
  border-radius:24px;padding:32px 30px;
}
.quiz-result h3{color:var(--crema);font-size:23px;margin:6px 0 10px;}
.quiz-result p#quizResultDesc{font-size:15px;color:#D9C9DB;line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 20px;}

/* ---- reseñas ---- */
.resenas-grid{margin-top:48px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;}
@media (max-width:860px){.resenas-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.resena-card{background:var(--crema-2);border-radius:22px;padding:28px 26px;transition:transform .22s ease, background .22s ease, box-shadow .22s ease;}
.resena-card:hover{transform:translateY(-5px) scale(1.02);background:#fff;box-shadow:0 16px 30px rgba(68,49,69,.12);}
.resena-card .stars{color:var(--mostaza);font-size:15px;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:12px;}
.resena-card .resena-text{font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--tinta);margin:0 0 16px;}
.resena-card .resena-author{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--tinta-suave);margin:0;}

/* ---- puntos de dolor (educación canina) ---- */
.dolor-grid{margin-top:40px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px 28px;}
@media (max-width:700px){.dolor-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.dolor-item{
  display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;
  font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--tinta);
  background:var(--crema-2);border-radius:18px;padding:18px 20px;
  transition:transform .2s ease, background .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
}
.dolor-item:hover{transform:translateY(-3px) scale(1.015);background:#fff;box-shadow:0 12px 24px rgba(68,49,69,.1);}
.dolor-dot{width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--mostaza);flex-shrink:0;margin-top:7px;}

/* ---- modalidad highlight ---- */
.modalidad-highlight{
  background:var(--crema-2);border-radius:18px;padding:20px 22px;margin-bottom:28px;
  font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--tinta-suave);
}
.modalidad-highlight strong{color:var(--tinta);font-family:'Nunito',sans-serif;font-weight:800;}
.modalidad-highlight.destacado{background:var(--tinta);color:#D9C9DB;}
.modalidad-highlight.destacado strong{color:var(--crema);}
.maps-link{
  display:inline-flex;margin-top:10px;color:var(--mostaza-suave);font-weight:800;font-size:14px;
  transition:color .2s ease;
}
.maps-link:hover{color:var(--mostaza);}

/* ---- independencia box ---- */
.independencia-box{margin-top:44px;background:var(--tinta);color:var(--crema);border-radius:24px;padding:30px 32px;text-align:center;}
.independencia-box p{margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;}
.independencia-box .script{display:block;margin-top:6px;font-size:23px;color:var(--mostaza-suave);}

/* ---- mini CTA banner ---- */
.cta-mini-box{
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;
  background:var(--crema-2);border-radius:26px;padding:32px 34px;
}
.cta-mini-box h3{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:500;max-width:480px;margin-top:4px;}

/* ---- cómo funciona (ruta) ---- */
.ruta{position:relative;margin-top:60px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:30px;}
.ruta-linea{position:absolute;top:26px;left:0;width:100%;height:60px;z-index:0;pointer-events:none;}
.parada{
  position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;
  opacity:0;transform:translateY(18px) scale(.96);
  transition:opacity .6s ease, transform .6s ease;
  transition-delay:calc(var(--d) * .12s);
}
.ruta.visible .parada{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0) scale(1);}
.parada-nodo{
  width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:50%;
  background:var(--tinta);color:var(--crema);
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:20px;
  margin:0 auto 16px;
  transition:transform .25s ease, background .25s ease, color .25s ease;
  box-shadow:0 8px 18px rgba(68,49,69,.18);
}
.parada:hover .parada-nodo{transform:scale(1.16);background:var(--mostaza);color:var(--tinta-mas);}
.parada h4{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:6px;}
.parada p{font-size:14px;color:var(--tinta-suave);line-height:1.55;margin:0;max-width:220px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;}
@media (max-width:820px){
  .ruta{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:38px;}
  .ruta-linea{display:none;}
  .parada{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;text-align:left;padding-left:70px;min-height:52px;}
  .parada-nodo{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;margin:0;}
  .parada p{margin-left:0;margin-right:0;max-width:none;}
}

/* ---- checklist "es para ti" ---- */
.check-list{margin-top:40px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;max-width:680px;}
.check-item{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;
  background:var(--crema-2);border-radius:18px;padding:18px 22px;
  cursor:pointer;border:1.5px solid transparent;
  transition:border-color .2s ease, background .2s ease, transform .2s ease;
}
.check-item:hover{transform:translateX(3px);}
.check-item.active{border-color:var(--mostaza);background:var(--mostaza-suave);}
.check-item input{
  appearance:none;-webkit-appearance:none;
  width:23px;height:23px;border-radius:7px;border:2px solid var(--lila);
  flex-shrink:0;cursor:pointer;position:relative;
  transition:background .2s ease, border-color .2s ease;
}
.check-item input:checked{background:var(--mostaza);border-color:var(--mostaza);}
.check-item input:checked::after{
  content:'';position:absolute;left:7px;top:3px;width:6px;height:11px;
  border:solid var(--tinta-mas);border-width:0 2px 2px 0;transform:rotate(40deg);
}
.check-item span{font-size:15.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--tinta);}
.check-result{
  margin-top:32px;max-width:620px;background:var(--tinta);color:var(--crema);
  border-radius:24px;padding:30px 30px;
}
.check-result p#checkResultText{font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#D9C9DB;margin:10px 0 22px;}

/* ---- incluye (tarjetas de colores) ---- */
.incluye-grid{margin-top:44px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;}
@media (max-width:900px){.incluye-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
@media (max-width:560px){.incluye-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.incluye-card{
  border-radius:24px;padding:28px 24px;
  transition:transform .25s ease, box-shadow .25s ease;
}
.incluye-card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px) scale(1.045) rotate(-1deg);box-shadow:0 18px 34px rgba(68,49,69,.18);}
.incluye-card .incluye-n{font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:26px;opacity:.5;}
.incluye-card h4{font-size:18px;margin:10px 0 8px;}
.incluye-card p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;margin:0;}
.incluye-card.c1{background:var(--mostaza-suave);color:var(--tinta-mas);}
.incluye-card.c2{background:var(--lila-suave);color:var(--tinta);}
.incluye-card.c3{background:var(--rosita);color:var(--tinta);}
.incluye-card.c4{background:var(--mantequilla);color:var(--tinta-mas);}

/* ---- whatsapp flotante ---- */
.whatsapp-float{
  position:fixed;right:20px;bottom:20px;z-index:200;
  width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:50%;
  background:#25D366;color:#fff;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(37,211,102,.4);
  transition:transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease;
}
.whatsapp-float:hover{transform:scale(1.06);box-shadow:0 14px 30px rgba(37,211,102,.5);}
@media (max-width:640px){
  .whatsapp-float{width:52px;height:52px;right:16px;bottom:16px;}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- reusable orejita curve -->
<svg width="0" height="0" style="position:absolute">
  <defs>
    <symbol id="orejita" viewBox="0 0 40 40">
      <path d="M4 30 C4 14, 16 4, 32 6 C 24 8, 16 16, 16 28 C16 34, 20 36, 26 34" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.4" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/>
    </symbol>
  </defs>
</svg>

<header class="site">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="#home" class="brand-mark" data-nav="home">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64," alt="Pechacan">
    </a>
    <nav class="links" id="navLinks">
      <button class="navlink" data-nav="home">Inicio</button>
      <button class="navlink" data-nav="educacion">Educación canina</button>
      <button class="navlink" data-nav="adopcion">Adopción</button>
      <button class="navlink" data-nav="reactividad">Reactividad</button>
      <button class="navlink" data-nav="contacto">Contacto</button>
      <a class="nav-cta mobile-only" href="https://wa.me/34636882884?text=Hola%20Pechacan%2C%20quiero%20una%20consulta%20gratuita" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="margin-top:14px;">Consulta gratuita</a>
    </nav>
    <a class="nav-cta desktop-only" href="https://wa.me/34636882884?text=Hola%20Pechacan%2C%20quiero%20una%20consulta%20gratuita" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Consulta gratuita</a>
    <button class="burger" id="burgerBtn" aria-label="Abrir menú">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </button>
  </div>
</header>

<main>

<!-- ============ HOME ============ -->
<section class="page active" id="page-home">
  <div class="hero-home">
    <div class="hero-bg" style="background-image:url('data:image/jpeg;base64,');"></div>
    <div class="hero-tint"></div>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Resultados reales y duraderos</p>
      <h1>Mejora la convivencia con tu perro y recupera la <em>calma</em> en casa.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Es el momento de dar el paso: entender qué le pasa a tu perro por dentro, por qué se comporta como se comporta, y ponerle solución práctica — sin dejarte la vida en el intento.</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <button class="btn btn-mostaza" data-nav="contacto" data-interes="Aún no lo sé, quiero contaros mi caso">Cuéntame tu caso</button>
        <button class="btn btn-outline" data-nav="educacion">Ver sesiones y precios</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="promo-banner">
    <div class="wrap promo-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow on-dark">Masterclass de reactividad</p>
        <h2 class="promo-headline">En 4 semanas consigues resultados.</h2>
      </div>
      <button class="btn btn-mostaza" data-nav="reactividad">Descubre la masterclass · 9,99€</button>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="div">

  <section>
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Cómo te podemos acompañar</p>
      <h2 class="title">Tres formas de empezar</h2>
      <div class="servicios-home">
        <button class="servicio-row" data-nav="educacion">
          <div class="left">
            <span class="num">01</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Sesiones de terapia canina</h3>
              <p class="desc">Online o presencial en Algeciras — observación, trabajo emocional y un informe después de cada sesión.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;">
            <span class="price">desde 40€</span>
            <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </button>
        <button class="servicio-row" data-nav="adopcion">
          <div class="left">
            <span class="num">02</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Concierge para adopción</h3>
              <p class="desc">Te acompañamos a elegir el perfil de perro compatible con tu casa, antes de que llegue.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;">
            <span class="price">desde 40€</span>
            <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </button>
        <button class="servicio-row" data-nav="reactividad">
          <div class="left">
            <span class="num">03</span>
            <div>
              <h3>Masterclass de reactividad</h3>
              <p class="desc">Un plan progresivo de 4 semanas para entender los tirones, ladridos y miedos de tu perro.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:18px;">
            <span class="price">9,99€</span>
            <svg class="arrow" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
          </div>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="mid-cta">
        <p>¿No tienes claro por dónde empezar?</p>
        <button class="btn btn-lila" data-nav="contacto" data-interes="Aún no lo sé, quiero contaros mi caso">Cuéntame tu caso</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="div">

  <section class="tight" id="quiz-section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Encuentra tu camino</p>
      <h2 class="title">¿Cuál es tu situación <em>ahora mismo</em>?</h2>
      <p class="lead">Elige la que más se parezca a lo que estáis viviendo y te decimos qué servicio encaja mejor.</p>

      <div class="quiz-options">
        <button class="quiz-opt" data-situacion="convivencia">
          <span class="q-mark script">01</span>
          <span>Mi perro tiene conductas que no sé gestionar</span>
        </button>
        <button class="quiz-opt" data-situacion="reactividad">
          <span class="q-mark script">02</span>
          <span>Mi perro tira, ladra o se pone nervioso con otros perros o personas</span>
        </button>
        <button class="quiz-opt" data-situacion="adopcion">
          <span class="q-mark script">03</span>
          <span>Estoy pensando en adoptar, o acabo de hacerlo</span>
        </button>
      </div>

      <div class="quiz-result" id="quizResult" hidden>
        <p class="eyebrow mostaza" id="quizResultTag"></p>
        <h3 id="quizResultTitle"></h3>
        <p id="quizResultDesc"></p>
        <button class="btn btn-mostaza" id="quizResultBtn">Ver este servicio</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="div">

  <section id="resenas">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Lo que cuentan las familias</p>
      <h2 class="title">Reseñas verificadas <em>en Google</em></h2>
      <div class="resenas-grid">
        <div class="resena-card">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="resena-text">Paula nos dio pautas muy efectivas para reconducir la conducta de nuestro Andy, con un seguimiento que no tiene precio. La recomendamos sin dudarlo.</p>
          <p class="resena-author">Familia de Andy</p>
        </div>
        <div class="resena-card">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="resena-text">Con la paciencia y el cariño de Paula estoy aprendiendo de verdad a entender a mi perro, no solo a corregirlo. Se nota el trabajo y la constancia.</p>
          <p class="resena-author">Reseña de Google</p>
        </div>
        <div class="resena-card">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <p class="resena-text">Sin la ayuda de Paula no habríamos conseguido pasear tranquilos con Thor. Ahora disfrutamos del paseo los dos, algo impensable antes.</p>
          <p class="resena-author">Familia de Thor</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <hr class="div">

  <section id="proceso">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">El camino</p>
      <h2 class="title">Cómo funciona</h2>
      <p class="lead">Cuatro paradas, un mismo camino: entender a tu perro y llegar a la calma.</p>

      <div class="ruta" id="ruta">
        <svg class="ruta-linea" viewBox="0 0 1000 60" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
          <path id="rutaPath" d="M20 30 C 260 -10, 260 70, 500 30 S 760 -10, 980 30" fill="none" stroke="var(--lila)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-dasharray="4 14"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="parada" style="--d:0">
          <div class="parada-nodo">1</div>
          <h4>Hablamos</h4>
          <p>Me explicas tu caso: cómo es la convivencia hoy y qué te gustaría que cambiara.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="parada" style="--d:1">
          <div class="parada-nodo">2</div>
          <h4>Consultoría inicial</h4>
          <p>Hacemos una evaluación para entender qué le pasa a tu perro de verdad.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="parada" style="--d:2">
          <div class="parada-nodo">3</div>
          <h4>Plan de acción</h4>
          <p>Diseñamos un plan personalizado, con pasos claros y a tu ritmo.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="parada" style="--d:3">
          <div class="parada-nodo">4</div>
          <h4>Acompañamiento</h4>
          <p>Te acompañamos hasta ver los resultados, sesión a sesión.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</section>

<!-- ============ EDUCACIÓN CANINA ============ -->
<section class="page" id="page-educacion">
  <div class="subhero lila-bg">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Sesiones de terapia canina</p>
      <h1>Sesiones 1 a 1 para entender y <em>reconducir las conductas de tu perro</em>.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Si los paseos son un tira y afloja, los ladridos no cesan o no sabes cómo calmar sus nervios, esto es para ti. Trabajamos contigo, sesión a sesión, hasta que sepas leer a tu perro y acompañarlo por tu cuenta.</p>
      <div class="cta-row" style="margin-top:32px;display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <button class="btn btn-mostaza" data-nav="contacto" data-interes="Sesión de educación canina">Quiero mi primera sesión</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">¿Te suena alguno de estos?</p>
      <h2 class="title">Lo que solemos <em>trabajar juntas</em></h2>
      <div class="dolor-grid">
        <div class="dolor-item"><span class="dolor-dot"></span>Tira de la correa en cada paseo, y salir a la calle se ha vuelto una lucha.</div>
        <div class="dolor-item"><span class="dolor-dot"></span>Ladra o se muestra agresivo con otros perros, personas u otros estímulos como coches o niños.</div>
        <div class="dolor-item"><span class="dolor-dot"></span>Sufre ansiedad por separación y no puedes dejarlo solo en casa.</div>
        <div class="dolor-item"><span class="dolor-dot"></span>Tiene nervios excesivos y no sabéis, ninguno de los dos, cómo bajar la intensidad.</div>
      </div>
      <p class="lead" style="margin-top:28px;">Todo esto tiene una explicación emocional — y un plan de trabajo real.</p>
